Set valid JWT authentication token in request header (Authorization: Bearer {token})
Prepare request body with missing required fields (e.g., missing name):

json   {
     "price": 250.00,
     "quantity": 50
   }

Send POST request to /api/plants/category/{categoryId}
Validate response status code
Validate error response body

Set valid JWT authentication token for TESTUSER in request header (Authorization: Bearer {token})
Prepare request body with valid plant data:

json   {
     "name": "Orchid White",
     "price": 500.00,
     "quantity": 30
   }

Send POST request to /api/plants/category/{categoryId}
Validate response status code
Validate error response body
